			"notes": "**IMPORTANT: UPDATE FABRIC API AND FABRIC LOADER TO LATEST BEFORE USING THIS VERSION OF CROWMAP**\n\nchanges:\n- massive performance improvements (i stopped using my brain-dead copy and paste rendering method)\n- support to display a player marker on dynmap even when player markers are disabled (for the client, not every player)\n- addition of a url bar in the map screen (must be enabled from settings)\n- additions to the right-click menu, including `route add WORLD X Z` and `copy X Z`\n- backend browser change to something *much* more stable and performant by default"
